    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.poster.avif?t=1713430003\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.webm?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.mp4?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU REACH THE SUN?</h2></strong><br><br>Explore the universe in a way never seen before in \u201cSolar Merge\u201d. Diverging from the conventional fruit-based merge games, &quot;Solar Merge&quot; offers an exhilarating journey through the cosmos, where planets are your canvas and the stars your playground.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERGE AND DISCOVER THE COSMIC ADVENTURE</strong></h2> <br>Each merge unveils a larger and more complex planetary body, challenging you to strategize and think galactically. With stylish graphics optimized for PC, experience the thrill of creating and expanding your own universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.poster.avif?t=1713430003\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.webm?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.mp4?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COSMIC YET INTUITIVE PUZZLE</strong></h2><br>Progress through levels, each offering a unique cosmic puzzle, set in a rich, visually captivating interstellar environment. &quot;Solar Merge&quot; combines intuitive gameplay with a depth that will keep you engaged for hours. Unlock mysteries of the galaxy, achieve astronomical wonders, and leave your mark in the universe.<br><br>Ready to redefine your merge game experience? &quot;Solar Merge&quot; offers an unparalleled blend of strategy, creativity, and interstellar exploration. Download now and start your galactic journey!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.poster.avif?t=1713430003\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.webm?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6859ec97c81881d15485de7894231bbc.mp4?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU REACH THE SUN?</h2></strong><br><br>Explore the universe in a way never seen before in \u201cSolar Merge\u201d. Diverging from the conventional fruit-based merge games, &quot;Solar Merge&quot; offers an exhilarating journey through the cosmos, where planets are your canvas and the stars your playground.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERGE AND DISCOVER THE COSMIC ADVENTURE</strong></h2> <br>Each merge unveils a larger and more complex planetary body, challenging you to strategize and think galactically. With stylish graphics optimized for PC, experience the thrill of creating and expanding your own universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.poster.avif?t=1713430003\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.webm?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797830/extras/6ec058344c30bb04ce8dcd9f8bbf7210.mp4?t=1713430003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COSMIC YET INTUITIVE PUZZLE</strong></h2><br>Progress through levels, each offering a unique cosmic puzzle, set in a rich, visually captivating interstellar environment. &quot;Solar Merge&quot; combines intuitive gameplay with a depth that will keep you engaged for hours. Unlock mysteries of the galaxy, achieve astronomical wonders, and leave your mark in the universe.<br><br>Ready to redefine your merge game experience? &quot;Solar Merge&quot; offers an unparalleled blend of strategy, creativity, and interstellar exploration. Download now and start your galactic journey!",
    "short_description": "Drop adorable planets to merge them and create even bigger magnificent celestial elements in this cozy physics puzzle game!",
